        "state": "closed",
        "title": "Migrate to Streamdown",
        "body": "This pull request refactors markdown rendering in the chat UI to use the new `streamdown` library, removes old markdown dependencies, and updates global styling and Tailwind configuration for improved theme support and consistency. The most important changes are listed below.\r\n\r\n**Markdown Rendering Refactor:**\r\n\r\n* Replaced the custom `MemoizedMarkdown` component and its dependencies (`marked`, `react-markdown`) with the `Streamdown` component for rendering markdown in chat messages (`app/chat/[id]/chat.tsx`, `app/chat/[id]/memoized-markdown.tsx`, `package.json`). ([app/chat/[id]/chat.tsxL8-R8](diffhunk://#diff-8efcc1be1e15529a35787d815f565a8db1092383c9ed7ceb47b6606e7b6f368bL8-R8), [app/chat/[id]/chat.tsxL80-R88](diffhunk://#diff-8efcc1be1e15529a35787d815f565a8db1092383c9ed7ceb47b6606e7b6f368bL80-R88), [app/chat/[id]/memoized-markdown.tsxL1-L32](diffhunk://#diff-05c8c5c624327cedc2a5348b6148772953623e5403cc20146ab44a7be2d2b4b5L1-L32), [package.jsonL16-R25](diffhunk://#diff-7ae45ad102eab3b6d7e7896acd08c427a9b25b346470d7bc6507b6481575d519L16-R25))\r\n\r\n**Dependency Updates:**\r\n\r\n* Removed unused markdown libraries (`marked`, `react-markdown`, `@tailwindcss/typography`) and added `streamdown` and `tailwindcss-animate` to dependencies (`package.json`).\r\n\r\n**Tailwind and Styling Improvements:**\r\n\r\n* Overhauled global CSS variables for color theming, added support for both light and dark modes, and applied background and text color via Tailwind classes (`app/globals.css`).\r\n* Updated Tailwind configuration to use new color variables, added container settings, border radius, font family, keyframes, and included the `tailwindcss-animate` plugin. Also added support for `streamdown` styles (`tailwind.config.ts`).\r\n\r\nThese changes modernize markdown rendering, simplify dependencies, and improve theme consistency across the application.",
